      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"text-container\">\n<h2>Wholesale</h2>\n<p>We offer wholesale programs that are as unique as your needs. We believe that no one company can do it all, so our focus is on being a part of the bigger coffee community here in Eugene. We support the development of specialty coffee through partnerships with coffee professionals and passionate businesses from all walks of life. Our team has been working hard to build a strong foundation for our business from the ground up; we’re actively seeking out new partnerships with local businesses who share our passion for quality coffee and customer service. We are excited to grow with you as we continue to expand our offerings.</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    },
