          }
        },
        "7ff98351-1fe5-40ce-b042-b3c1753457d5": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Coffee is the lifeblood of a productive office. And if you’re paying upwards of $2 a cup in your breakroom, you could be spending hundreds of dollars every month on mediocre coffee. With Farmers Union, you can brew better coffee at your office than you’ll ever find at Starbucks, and it costs just pennies per cup.</p>",
