    "ab6bd86f-dd1a-4b01-a11a-0149bc563896": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "65fb99ce-e55f-47fe-881c-2ff375b08117": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Service Center Programs",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "5eb19271-ed67-4013-8294-30dcaa0a410c": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Are you a car dealership, repair shop, or high traffic business that loves treating it’s customers to a cup of coffee while they wait? Treat them to the best coffee experience possible with Farmers Union coffee. Our programs are designed to elevate your coffee offering from basic to cafe standard, with fresh micro-lots and simple brewing solutions that make sense for high traffic establishments with minimal equipment.</p>",
