    "8dc61a26-8e0b-4187-9284-3c8b92a9d6c7": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "4aa0f8d3-4460-45cb-ad2d-18db2b72db8b": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Grocery Stores",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "b268399a-4d28-42f7-ac5d-9da454d67921": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>It’s no secret that coffee goes stale after only a few weeks, and your customers are going to notice if they get a cup of coffee that’s old and stale. Farmers Union will come replace any bag of coffee that hasn’t <br/>sold after 4 weeks – at no cost to you. You’ll never have to worry about stale coffee in your inventory again! We know how important it is to make sure your customers are getting the best product possible, so we <br/>offer this service as a way for us to show you how much we care about our partnership with you.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
        "db2b9c3a-5c11-4460-84c9-01d0605dad44": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
